+
+        I**r -> (-1)**(r/2) -> exp(r/2*Pi*I) -> sin(Pi*r/2) + cos(Pi*r/2)*I, r is decimal, handled by ``Pow``
+        I**0 mod 4 -> 1, handled by ``Pow``
+        I**1 mod 4 -> I, handled by ``Pow``
+        I**2 mod 4 -> -1, handled by ``Pow``
+        I**3 mod 4 -> -I, handled by ``Pow``
         """
 
         if isinstance(expt, Number):
